      "content": "it feels like the \"consensus-building\" thing you mentioned is just a way for the UN to tie the hands of stronger countries while they just argue endlessly. do you think the whole concept of global governance is basically just a way to erode national sovereignty in favor of an unelected bureaucracy?",
